{"ID":"20240314091807-dtu279d","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091807-dtu279d","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091807-dtu279d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171122-9nyapdy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171122-y842f1f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171122-y842f1f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:119,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:119\u0026#125;","title":"【白术散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171122-9nyapdy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-9nyapdy","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妊娠养胎，白术散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-ob12x8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-ob12x8x","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-4dqr7ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-4dqr7ii","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白朮川芎蜀椒去汗牡蛎各三分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-t51h0jg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-t51h0jg","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，杵为散，酒服一钱匕。日三服，夜一服。但苦痛加芍药；心下毒痛倍加芎藭；心烦吐痛不能食饮，加细辛一两，半夏大者二十枚。服之后，更以醋浆水服之。若呕，以醋浆水服之；复不解者，小麦汁服之。已后渴者，大麦粥服之，病虽愈，服之勿置。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-qvfxnta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-qvfxnta","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那后面呢叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妊娠养胎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"它写的很清楚嘛，这个养小孩的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-hqmyz6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-hqmyz6j","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果怀孕不知道如何调理，结果很多太太肚子饿就乱吃啊！吃了就变成超级大婴儿，婴儿很大，头也很大，排不出来。那按现在来说你还要剖腹产对不对？那过去古代呢，你婴儿头那么大，身体那么大，排不出来，生不出来怎么办？所以说我们会有白术散。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-3ozyt6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-3ozyt6k","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术散是养胎用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大家看，这个白术散里面有牡蛎，你看中医几千年前就知道用牡蛎，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎就是什么？钙！钙片，所以以前我们就知道要补钙"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜀椒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，它是辛辣的...大建中汤里面有蜀椒，就是因为他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能够温下焦，配合川芎能够活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术能去它的湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般来说我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在第六个月开始到第十个月，最后的五个月呢，我们给妈妈吃这个白术散，白术散会把小孩子养的很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，也不会养的超级巨婴出来啊！那骨骼会养的很好，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"前面先养妈妈，后面再养小孩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-xdpabbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-xdpabbz","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说老师，如果说我们妈妈吃当归散同时吃白术散，对不对？那可以分开来吃，那也可以呀，无所谓。你如果按照经方来做很简单，像我们刚刚那个妇女怀孕中间如果要流产的时候啊，下血很重的时候，一般南方温病派的会说我们有十三太保，我们有那个...很多处方，经方我们用那个就可以了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里倪师说的应该是胶艾汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），我们前面教的...不用那个十三太保。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-96kjeiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-96kjeiq","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这四味药呢，也把它做成散剂，那白天吃三次，晚上吃一次，等于二十四小时吃四次，六小时一剂哦。如果说这个怀孕的妇人呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痛，就芍药加重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你看这个粉剂很好支配，中药好处就在这里面，它每一个药是分开的，所以你要调配的时候，看每一个人不一样，剂量加减都可以调整。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心下毒痛，胃里面痛呢加倍川芎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心烦吐痛不能食饮，加细辛半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，半夏能够止呕啊！那如果说还有你还可以用醋，如果恶心的更厉害可以用醋，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"醋可以去止呕，酸的可以止恶心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。还有呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小麦喝完以后口渴，用大麦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。小麦和大麦在本草经的定义不太一样，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小麦是心之谷，管心脏啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那大麦呢，主要着重于肠，肠子。所以说我们有的药，用大麦粥去喝，有的药小麦粥来喝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那要看病人的情形。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171122-y842f1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171122-y842f1f","updated":"20240422171122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面我们会介绍一个甘麦大枣汤，就是用的小麦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以当你肠胃的经液不足的时候，大麦，当你病人如果情志上有问题的时候，小麦，因为它是心之谷嘛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如说忧郁呀，烦躁呀，对不对？看先生没回来就要疯，看什么都不对，就摔东西，我们给它小麦哦。诸如此类的。"}]}]}